    "detailed_description": "Ultimate Obstacle Course - Prologue<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the first episode of an infinite playground of possibilities, where intense, adrenaline-fueled free running meets immersive VR simulation. Run, jump and slide your way through a virtual gauntlet with your body as the controller, and prove yourself to be the ultimate obstacle runner. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompetitors and level designers will have the tools to create challenging and visually striking courses in VR. Combine varieties of blocks and game mechanics to create all new courses and a completely customised gameplay experience. You\u2019ll be able to share your levels, challenge your friends, and even participate in high stakes tournaments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake it. Run it. Share it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUltimate Obstacle Course - Prologue is a small taste of the much bigger vision from Dark Slope, to create an incredible competitive and creative community of runners and designers. As well as a platform to build, create, play and share experiences with friends, we are making a competitive VR esport that everyone can be a part of.",
    "about_the_game": "Ultimate Obstacle Course - Prologue<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the first episode of an infinite playground of possibilities, where intense, adrenaline-fueled free running meets immersive VR simulation. Run, jump and slide your way through a virtual gauntlet with your body as the controller, and prove yourself to be the ultimate obstacle runner. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompetitors and level designers will have the tools to create challenging and visually striking courses in VR. Combine varieties of blocks and game mechanics to create all new courses and a completely customised gameplay experience. You\u2019ll be able to share your levels, challenge your friends, and even participate in high stakes tournaments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake it. Run it. Share it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUltimate Obstacle Course - Prologue is a small taste of the much bigger vision from Dark Slope, to create an incredible competitive and creative community of runners and designers. As well as a platform to build, create, play and share experiences with friends, we are making a competitive VR esport that everyone can be a part of.",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the first taste of an infinite playground of possibilities, where intense, adrenaline-fueled free running meets immersive VR simulation. Run, jump and slide your way through a virtual gauntlet with your body as the controller, and prove yourself to be the ultimate obstacle runner.",
